window.products.push({"id":364014,"name":"SQUIREME. Y1 Borosilicate Glass Water Bottles, Clear Bottle, Reusable, BPA Free, Tumbler, Dishwasher Safe, Drink Container, Silicone Sleeve, Easy-Off ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SNbdAM+kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SAFE like no other water bottle on the market. The handmade Borosilicate glass bottle is much stronger and lighter than regular glass; it preserves the ultra-pure taste and will not leach chemicals or taste like metal containers. Our water bottles are BPA/BPS Free. The thermally stable borosilicate glass used to make our bottles is also used in chemistry labs due to it's strength in durability. Our glass drinking bottles are Cadium free, phthalate-free, Leadless, and non-toxic. THERMOS be gone. Our bottles can be used for hot or cold beverages. The 1 1/2 inch opening is perfect as its wide mouth is big enough to slip in ice cubes, but not to spill all over when drinking. The Silicone sleeve is protective and provides a great grip even in hot environments. You won't find another glass water bottle that is this versatile. CAP Industry-leading and patented 1 turn bottle cap, means you twist the cap 180 degrees and it's off. No more fumbling with caps to unscrew, just simply twist and drink. The different colors in the Y1 collection provides endless options as premium glass water bottles so you stay cool, stylish, and hydrated. REUSABLE water botttle that can go straight into the dishwasher after removing the sustainably-sourced leather strap. This allows your glass bottle to be reusable for years to come. Being the perfect size of 20 ounces there is no need to fill up your water bottle every 5 minutes! You can also bring your water bottle with you while you travel as it is easy to bring in the car, plane, or train. LEAK PROOF water bottles designed in Switzerland by a family looking for more pure-tasting and sleeker alternative to metal water containers. Upgrade your flask now! The perfect gifts for men and women.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SNbdAM+kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SQUIREME.","source_asin":"B0C5YRZFVB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-364014","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5YRZFVB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5YRZFVB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
