window.products.push({"id":364071,"name":"VENO Foldable Storage Bin Cube Organizer, 4-Pack, Heavy-Duty Collapsible Basket with Handles for Toy Clothes Linen Sundry 10.5\"x10.5\"x10.5\" Fits Shelv","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FymlOAU8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Classic Design: VENO Cube Storage Bins are a perfect way to organize and store items at home, office, loft and other dwellings. The classic design and color match interior decor and style in any room at home or office. Use alone or with a cube bookshelf, cabinet, or other shelving systems. Fits the IKEA KALLAX cube shelves perfectly as well as most shelving systems and cube bookshelves. Medium Size: 10.5\"X10.5\"X10.5\" - 5 Gallon Volume. Premium Storage Cubes with Great Quality: VENO storage bins are incredibly durable. These bins are made from our premium 220 GSM coated polypropylene woven material which is durable and sturdy. They are easy to clean with wipes, easy to maintain, and water resistant. The handles are made of thick and strong poly webbing and they will safely hold up to 25 lbs. VENO storage bins are 3 times sturdier and longer lasting than cheap bins. Foldable Storage Cubes: VENO collapsible storage cube can be folded up completely flat and into a small size for easy storage in a drawer, closet, car or luggage. With its well-constructed design and cardboard support, the organizer stays upright and firm. The heave duty webbing handles, reinforced bottom, and rigid inserted cardboards make these fabric storage cubes strong, durable and last forever! Multi-Purpose Storage Cubes: Wonderful bins for organization in any room. These fabric bins have plenty of space to store and protect any item. Perfect for closet storage; Kids room and toy storage; DVD, book, and media storage; Bathroom tissue and sundry storage; Shelf organizers; Laundry room storage; Pantry organization; Linen and towel storage; Car/vehicle grocery containers and many other ways to organize and store. 3 Months Warranty: Our unique and classic design cube storage bins come with a 90-Day warranty. Contact us for any problem and we will ship a new organizer FREE of charge or provide you a better solution. Customers are our top priority. If you are not happy, we are not happy!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FymlOAU8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VENO","source_asin":"B07YYPZKLV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-364071","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YYPZKLV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YYPZKLV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
