window.products.push({"id":364230,"name":"UCheer Cordless 15x Performance of Active Charcoal Patented Air Purification Tech Formaldehyde Remover Odor Eliminator for Closet Fridge Locker Smell ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SCAH8CunL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Out Performs Peers — UCheer Q8’s signature CH-CUT uses catalyst-based technology to decompose TVOCs and organic odors. It achieves 15X performance against active carbon which saturates over time and have to be replaced. It is also safer than Ozone purifying solutions Nano Catalyst — In electronic microscope, CH-CUT granules show a thorough contact with air that multiply its performance and capability to handle low-density TVOCs and odors. Unlike CH-CUT, charcoal is unable to absorb bad molecules under a density threshold due to its micro-structure limitation Decade-Long Life with No Power Needed — CH-CUT is a catalyst without need for external power, it will not be consumed or dissipated or saturated over time, making it stay in prime efficiency for decade. For Multi-Purpose Needs — UCheer Q8 works best in a confined space like locker, locket, show cabinet, fridge and all enclosed spaces leaking disturbing gases NOT A ONE SOLUTION FOR ALL — We did extensive experiments and we want to be frank that, it is not always working for odors with non-organic compounds like ammonia, chlorine etc. But at least Q8 could help to inhibit germs from reproduction","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SCAH8CunL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UCheer","source_asin":"B07HDH6T9Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-364230","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HDH6T9Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HDH6T9Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
