window.products.push({"id":364262,"name":"Homsee Modern Shoe Storage Cabinet with 3 Flip Drawers, Wood 3-Tier Shoe Rack Storage Organizer for Entryway, Hallway & Bedroom, White (31.6”L x 9.3”W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":169.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zugr5OF1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description Homsee wooden shoe storage cabinet with 3 flip drawers offers additional storage space and won't occupy your room space. This shoe rack cabinet fits with any space and house decor, it will bring your home neat and add modern charm, you can place it in entryway, hallway, living room, bedroom, change room, corridor and other occasions. Specification Color: White Material: PB board Overall Dimensions: 31.6”L x 9.3”W x 42.6”H Gross weight: 59.4 lbs","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zugr5OF1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homsee","source_asin":"B0BW917SWT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-364262","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BW917SWT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BW917SWT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":364263,"name":"Tripolis Aphrodite 100% Cotton Turkish Beach Bath Spa Sauna Pool Yoga Towel Pestemal 37\"x70\",Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81j0HG5p11L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Peshtemal is a traditional towel used in baths. It is indispensable part of Ottoman hamam culture, dating back hundreds of years; the pestemal was originally designed to help individual bathers maintain their privacy. Additional to its absorbent character, pestemals dry faster than thicker towels. Cotton has long fibers that open up with use, allowing the thin towels to be highly absorbent. The peshtemal absorbs water as fast as a traditional towel, dries very quickly, takes up less space, is easy to carry and is therefore used as an alternative to the towel in bathrooms, pools, spas, beaches, sport facilities, and for baby care. The peshtemal fabric is made of 100% cotton produced in manually operated looms or automated machines in modern Turkey, historically in Tripolis. ADVANTAGES OF PESHTEMAL Light Weight Thin Highly absorbent Fast drying Easy to carry than a towel Takes up less space than a towel Unisex Eco friendly Durable Multi purpose use THE PLACES YOU CAN USE PESHTEMAL Bath Beach Pool Spa Sauna Hamam Massage Salons Gym Yoga Centers Pilates Centers Outdoor Sports Kitchen Home Décor","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81j0HG5p11L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tripolis","source_asin":"B084KQGNBK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-364263","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084KQGNBK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084KQGNBK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
