window.products.push({"id":364268,"name":"LZYMSZ Accent Storage Cabinet with Door and Shelves, Free Standing Accent Side Cabinet, Large Cube Toy Box Storage Organizer for Kids Playroom Kindgar","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":65.52,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5133k5ufe3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Specifications: Package Included: Storage cabinet accessories; an assembly instruction. Material: Made of MDF Color: White, Yellow Assembled dimensions: 26.8in/68cm W x 35.8in/91cm H x 12.6in/32cm D. Drawer dimensions: 26.8in/68cm W x 7.9in/20cm H x 12.6in/32cm D. Weight: 44.1lb/20kg Why Choose SITAKE Storage Cabinet 【Attractive Design】Accent cabinet looks like a snail tentacle, which is designed to meet the aesthetics of children. The hollow exterior design gives you a clear view of the cabinet’s contents. 【Large Capacity Space】 With a spacious tabletop and 2 interior shelves, SITAKE storage cabinet provides ample storage space for your children’s toys, books or items. A spacious tabletop can be used to display your plants, photos and decorations; the 2 internal shelves behind the door are perfect for storing toys, books, boxes or other large items. The distinctive design of the bottom shelf is to store large toys.  【Versatile Use】Wooden cabinet storage with doors and shelves can be used as toy chest for plush toys, blocks or model cars; bookcase for books and magazines; accent cabinet for decorations and sundries; and file cabinet for small printers and storage of documents.  【Easy To Assemble】Our storage cabinet is easy to assemble and comes with an assembly instruction. Just follow the instruction for quick assembly.  Care Instructions  No direct sunlight.  No immersion in water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5133k5ufe3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LZYMSZ","source_asin":"B097B4QVJV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-364268","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097B4QVJV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097B4QVJV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
