window.products.push({"id":364367,"name":"Season’s Need Artificial Flowers 84pcs Real Looking Aqua Green Bulk Fake Roses Bouquet with Baby’s Breath for DIY Wedding Bouquets Baby Shower Centerp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gbX5H1IoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GREAT VALUE – Set of 12 Roses bouquet with a total of 84 rose flowers approximately measures 10” long and 4” wide; You don't need to replace them frequently, saving you money on buying fresh flowers regularly. Additionally, artificial rose flowers can be reused for various occasions, reducing the need for purchasing new floral arrangements each time. LIFELIKE APPEARANCE - High-quality Aqua-green flowers made of silk; crafted with attention to detail, resulting in a remarkably realistic and natural appearance. The texture, color variations, and intricate details of the petals closely resemble those of real flowers. This allows silk flowers to create a visually stunning display that can be mistaken for fresh flowers. LONG LASTING - Silk flowers are known for their durability and longevity. Unlike fresh flowers that wilt and wither within days, silk flowers can maintain their beauty for years when properly cared for. They do not require water, sunlight, or specific environmental conditions, making them an ideal choice for long-lasting floral arrangements and decor ALLERGY-FRIENDLY - Faux flowers are hypoallergenic and do not produce pollen or have fragrances that can trigger allergies. This makes them a safe and comfortable option for individuals with pollen sensitivities or respiratory issues. You can enjoy the beauty of flowers without worrying about allergic reactions. VERSATILE – Season’s need Artificial rose flowers are available in a wide variety of types, colors, and styles, allowing for endless possibilities in floral arrangements. They are not limited by season or availability, making it easy to find and use your preferred flowers at any time of the year. Additionally, silk flowers can be easily combined with other artificial foliage or flowers to create custom arrangements that suit your taste and decor style. PERFECT FOR ANY SEASON - Faux rose bouquets are not limited by seasons or availability. You can enjoy your favorite rose colors and varieties throughout the year, regardless of whether they are in season or not. This makes silk roses a reliable choice for decorating your home or for special events, no matter the time of year. SENTIMENTAL VALUES - Silk bouquets can hold sentimental value and serve as lasting mementos. They can be preserved and cherished as a reminder of a special occasion, such as a wedding, anniversary, or meaningful event. Silk roses can evoke emotions and memories for years to come. TIMELESS BEAUTY – Fake flower bouquet offer timeless beauty that can enhance any space or occasion. The meticulous craftsmanship and attention to detail in silk roses create a stunningly realistic appearance that closely resembles fresh roses. These bouquets can capture the elegance, charm, and romance associated with real roses.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gbX5H1IoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SN Decor","source_asin":"B08CZH5LFJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-364367","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CZH5LFJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CZH5LFJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
