window.products.push({"id":364382,"name":"Bayberry Room Spray, 2 Ounces, Fragrant Aromatic Room Mist","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fbr80oopL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"REFRESH YOUR ROOM - Our room sprays help to eliminate unpleasant odors in your home while adding a pleasing light fragrance. FOR A STRONGER SCENT - Our Double Strength formula contains double the fragrance of our original room sprays for people who prefer a stronger room spray. NON-AEROSOL BOTTLE - Our Room Sprays come in a non-aerosol bottle with a fine mist sprayer. Our Bayberry fragrance is a traditional holiday blend of bayberry, spice and clove. This fragrance is phthalate free. Handcrafted in the USAPreservative Free, Dye Free, Paraben Free","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fbr80oopL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eclectic Lady","source_asin":"B0B6JRKHB5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-364382","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6JRKHB5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6JRKHB5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":364383,"name":"Home-X Analog Alarm Clock with Quartz Movement, Square Battery-Operated Bedside Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WVY2LmJzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Finding the right alarm clock can be such a hassle, and if you get stuck with the wrong alarm clock, you’ll probably wake up on the wrong side of the bed more than you’ll want to admit. Starting your day off right is important, and that is why we created this classy analog alarm clock. It includes tons of useful features that make it the perfect new addition to your bedroom. Whether you’re planning to set it on a nightstand, side table, kitchen counter, or desk, you won’t have to worry about hiding any cords or not being able to reach the nearest wall outlet. Our clock helps to simplify your life and only requires batteries to run. One of the unique features that makes this clock amazing is that it is compact. This feature makes it the perfect travel buddy. Whether you’re going on a business trip or a camping trip, this alarm clock will make sure you get up on the right side of the bed (or sleeping bag). The clock face is a classic white color with clearly shown numbers and thick hands to make reading the time easier than ever. Setting the alarm, hitting snooze, and putting in new batteries can all be done in the back of the clock (the clock includes simple image instructions). Unlike some clocks on the market, our alarm clock doesn’t have a shrill or otherwise annoying sound. It is loud enough to wake you up but gentle enough to keep you from waking with a jolt. Your new black square alarm clock will complement nearly any color scheme or decor style in your home and add a touch of class. Get your very own analog alarm clock today and see the difference it can make!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WVY2LmJzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B07MYN5DL2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-364383","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MYN5DL2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MYN5DL2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
