window.products.push({"id":364444,"name":"KING DARE Cow Print Blanket Soft Cozy Fleece Flannel Cow Blanket for Couch Bed Plush Autumn Lightweight Sofa Throws for Adults Black and White Cowhide","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OivMYao9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🐄Softer and Warmer. Upgraded flannel double-sided cow blanket is made of 330 GSM microfiber, light weight, soft, warm enough to be comfortable and skin friendly for children, babies and family members. Black and white cow print blanket with high fleece blanket's quality material, good to wrap you in warmth and comfort on cold nights. 🌻Choose the Right Size, small blanket(40x50inch), suitable as a Baby blanket for children's naps and as a swaddling blanket for babies. The throw blanket(50x60inch), which it's lightweight and easy to carry, is suitable as an a outdoor blanket, suitable as a sofa blanket and travel blanket. Large blanket (60x80inch), which would be more suitable as a bed blanket for the bedroom. 🌻On A Cold Night, When Watching Tv Shows On The Sofa, This Is Your Warm Companion, Camping Picnic Lunch Trip Is Your Essential Equipment. (bed blanket / pets blanket/ kids blanket / shawl blanket / air-conditional blanket / nap blanket /travelling blanket /camping blanket /picnic blanket)It is also the best choice for birthday, Valentine's day, mother's day, father's day, Thanksgiving, Easter, Christmas and other festivals. 🌻Gift of Love: Cow pattern blanket, combining farm design and black and white Holstein cow pattern, perfect for those who love farm decor for a special bedroom decorating experience. Warm cow gift that is perfect for friends or family on Birthdays, Valentine's Day, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Thanksgiving, Easter, Christmas and other holidays. 😊Lifetime Warranty. We have a professional customer service team to serve you, if you have any dissatisfaction for these cow plush blankets, please contact us at any time, we guarantee that we will give you a satisfactory solution. 😊Easy Care: Please clean the cow fleece blanket separately. Machine wash in cold water, washing temperature should not exceed 30° , no bleaching. Low temperature drying. Avoid long exposure to sunlight, dry in a cool and ventilated place.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OivMYao9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KING DARE","source_asin":"B09J19F2V9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-364444","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J19F2V9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J19F2V9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
