window.products.push({"id":364542,"name":"Oven Air Fryer Basket and Tray, Extra Large Crisper Tray and Basket Stainless Steel, Non-stick Mesh Basket Set, Air Fryer Tray Wire Rack Roasting Bask","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F2ZmW2VgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High-Quality Stainless Steel Air Fryer Basket for Oven Made of premium 304 stainless steel, the air fryer basket is high-temperature resistant, has no deformation, durable. 360-degree heat circulation Stainless steel non-stick coating Multi-purpose Heat resistant A cooling rack, cookie sheet, baking sheet ishwasher Safe Less Fat & Calories No Turning & No Burning 360° Heat Circulation A Mesh basket is above the tray allowing the entire contents of the tray to be surrounded & absorb the heat being emitted. No need to turn or flip your food - making food crispy on the outside but juicy and tender on the inside. DISHWASHER SAFE After the cooking, you can place the mesh basket in the dishwasher for quick and easy cleanup. Package Contents 2 x Crisper Tray  2 x Crisper Basket","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F2ZmW2VgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Varycony","source_asin":"B0C5Y5WCBZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-364542","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5Y5WCBZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5Y5WCBZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":364543,"name":"JONYJ Cocktail Shaker Set Bartender Kit with Bamboo Stand, 14-Piece Stainless Steel Bar Set, Sturdy Cocktail Kit, Professional Bar Tools for Drink Mix","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XwYRW4otL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍸【14-PIECE COCKTAIL SHAKER SET】Designed for mixing a variety of beverages, our mixology bartender kit provides all the essential tools. With large capacity shaker, jigger, hawthorne strainer and other tools, help you to mix all kind of impressive cocktail. Plus, whether you're a novice bartender or a pro, the cocktail shaker set include an exquisite cocktail recipe to give you plenty of inspiration. Let you and your friends enjoy freshly prepared cocktails from the comfort of your home 🍸【PREMIUM STAINLESS STEEL MATERIAL】This cocktail shaker set is made of food grade high quality stainless steel, which is safe for drinkers and won’t affect the taste. Rust-resistant and lightweight, made to last. Our professional bartender kit designed with an elegant mirror finish that’s antismudge and fingerprint-free. In addition, all parts of this cocktail shaker set are dishwasher friendly for quick and easy cleaning 🍸【BARTENDER KIT WITH STYLISH BAMBOO STAND】The bar set is equipped with a well-designed natural bamboo stand to keep your barware tools scratch-safe. For each specific tool, the stand has fixed locations and indents in corresponding locations. Keep your bar tidy and avoid clutter and lost tools, and easily find the bartending tools you need. In addition, the stylish stand has a unique appearance and a convenient design to make the cocktail shaker set look more attractive, upscale and elegant 🍸【VERSATILE USE】If you are a cocktail lover, you could use it to create delicious and beautiful drinks made from a wide variety of liquors. The exquisite cocktail recipe feature 30 kinds of liquor recipes including Whiskey, Scotch, Vodka, Tequila, Gin, Rum, Brandy, Sake, Martini, Margarita and Manhattan, among others. Inviting friends and mixing a unique wine them may enhance each other's feelings 🍸【GREAT GIFT】This 14-piece cocktail shaker set is a nice gift for beginner or long-time pro. This mixology bartender kit comes in an elegant packaging with a stylish bamboo stand designed to hold everything. For novices, this cocktail shaker set can kickstart their mixology practice, while professionals will love the durable, premium quality of our bar tools. There's no more suitable gift than this bar shaker set for a cocktail lover whenever in birthday, Christmas, anniversary and so on","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XwYRW4otL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JONYJ","source_asin":"B08R8YBDGY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-364543","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R8YBDGY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R8YBDGY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
