window.products.push({"id":364555,"name":"HUFATWINS Handheld Vacuum Cordless, Car Vacuum Cleaner Lightweight Hand Held Vacuuming 9000Pa Strong, 3H Fast-Charge Wet Dry Portable Mini Vacuum for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Vpd+NwJvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HUFATWINS handheld vacuum cordless is a great helper. Choose HUFATWINS to make your life easier and more comfortable. Quick charge and long using time Handheld Vacuum cleaner battery: 2200mA*3 battery, can be used for 30 minutes after charging for 3 hours Vacuum cleaner filtration system: dust separation using cyclone technology (not easy to block filter), double filtration (honey cone + HEPA filtration) Our charging system also provides over-voltage protection,over-current protection and over-temperature protection to make sure it is safe. How to use it ? Long Soft Hose: Could help to absorb cracks, corners, underside of table, underside of car seat and other hard to clean areas. it can be used in difficult to reach places such as corners (with this accessory, the suction will be relatively concentrated and will not be dissipated). Crevice nozzle: Could absorb dust from the sofa space / car seat space. Brush nozzle: Can quickly remove garbage and debris from flat surfaces.. What contains in your package? 1x handheld vacuum cleaner cordless  1x long flexible tube  1x crevice nozzle  1x brush nozzle  1x English Manual  1x standard adapter Attention: Please fully charge the vacuum when receiving the vacuum. Fully charge until the green light is on. The vacuum can only be charged under power supply by dedicated charger of the company. The vacuum cannot be operated constantly for quite long time. Generally pause for 1-2 minutes after 10-12 minutes of operating in order to protect the electrical motor Clean the filter net in time in order not to affect the dust collection efficiency. The filter net can be washed. Dry by the air after washing. When run out of battery, charge the vacuum after turning off the power, otherwise it could not be charged.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Vpd+NwJvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HUFATWINS","source_asin":"B0B8X7CNZ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-364555","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8X7CNZ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8X7CNZ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
