window.products.push({"id":364631,"name":"MLADEN Hanger Spacers Clothes Hanger Divider Outdoor Windproof Clothes Hanger Hook Anti-Slip Silicone Spacers for Clothes Rack/Rod 10PCS(red)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Nw7UPAVBL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"You can't miss the multifunctional hanger spacers. For Indoor Closet: Try MLADEN's Hanger Spacers to make your closet tidier and more orderly. Your clothes will not be crushed, wrinkled, smushed together.Then you don't have to spend extra time ironing. For Outdoor Clothes Rack/Rod: Being windproof, MLADEN's Hanger Hooks can prevent your hangers from slipping and falling, and keep a fixed gap between clothes for quick drying. User Friendly: Made of Degradable Environment-Friendly Silicon gel, the spacer is good for you and your family members. Specification Material: Degradable Environment-Friendly Silicon gel internal diameter: 24mm/0.94\" external diameter: 50mm/1.96\" width: 22mm/0.86\" Applicable Clothes Rack: 2.4-2.8cm(0.94\"-1.10\") in diameter Color:Red Package Includes: 10PCS Clothes Hanger Spacers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Nw7UPAVBL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MLADEN","source_asin":"B07GYR23NT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-364631","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GYR23NT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GYR23NT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":364632,"name":"Department 56 North Pole Flight Training","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615BxY-y+9S._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Just how do those reindeer learn to fly? Santa has established a rigorous course and this reindeer is put through his paces by a diligent elf. This animated accessory stands almost nine inches tall and includes its own power adapter. Designed and manufactured exclusively by Department 56.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615BxY-y+9S._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B00141LNVE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-364632","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00141LNVE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00141LNVE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":364633,"name":"See All SN12 Convex Mirror, Shatter Resistant Glass Face, Indoor Use, 12\" Diameter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OvWMv3Y8L._SL1217_.jpg","description":"The See All SN12 convex mirror is a circular, convex, shatter-resistant glass mirror, with a 12\" diameter, that reflects a wide angle image at a diminished size to extend a field of view to help a person see around obstacles for safety, or monitor a wide area for efficient surveillance. Shatter-resistant glass (also called laminated glass) is scratch resistant, withstands frequent cleaning, reflects a clear, bright image, and is laminated to hold the glass together in the frame if broken. The mirror comes with a swivel mounting bracket that makes it adjustable to a wide range of angles. The 12\" diameter size is suitable for use in small areas and spot applications. This mirror has a tempered hardboard backing for good strength-to-weight ratio in indoor applications. Tempered hardboard is a high-density fiberboard that has been coated with linseed oil and then baked to increase its water resistance, rigidity, and tensile strength. Safety mirrors are used to help increase visibility in a variety of locations; for example, in hallway intersections and sharp turns, and in driveways and loading docks where drivers have to back up or enter traffic. Safety mirrors are sometimes called security mirrors, and they can be used to extend the view of security personnel, or to help monitor factory workers and automated processes to improve quality control and productivity. For convex mirrors, objects will appear to be further away than they are, and will be easier to see in a larger mirror. Depending on visibility conditions and the viewer's eyesight, objects will usually be recognizable within about 1 ft. of distance (including distance from eye to mirror, and from mirror to object) for each inch in mirror diameter. See All Industries manufactures safety and security mirrors. The company, founded in 1958, is headquartered in Chicago, IL. What's in the Box Offset bracket Offset bracket Nut with washer Nut with washer Installation instructions Installation instructions","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OvWMv3Y8L._SL1217_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SeeAll","source_asin":"B008Y5PTDQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-364633","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008Y5PTDQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008Y5PTDQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":364634,"name":"Hand Forged Meat Cleaver 6.3 Inch Kitchen Chef Knife with Leather Sheath and Gift Box Outdoor Butcher Knife Hammered Chopper Boning Knife for Home, Ca","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717RAAlzy-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM MATERIAL -- The sturdy chef knife is made of extraordinary quality 5Cr15Mov high carbon steel and reaches the hardness of 58 HRC. It performs better to maintain sharp edges than ordinary stainless steel.(Due to the high content of carbon, please keep the knife clean and dry after use to resist rust). Red sandalwood handle provides slip resistance, and the curved design is great for your hand to hold. RAZOR SHARP BLADE -- Hand-polished 16 degree edge on each side makes the blade ultra sharp, and helps you cutting smoothly with ease. The seamless Full-Tang design prevent the blade from falling easily. The blade is hand-forged with the unique 45 degrees on the top and it’s passed multi-channel composite processes for fine grinding and durability. UNIQUE LEATHER SHEATH -- The cleaver knife is equipped with a practical soft leather Sheath. It can protect the blade well and you can put on a belt for easy carrying when camping outdoor. With this stylish leather sheath and elegant box, it’s an excellent gift for your lovers, parents, friends who are cooking enthusiasts. MULTIPURPOSE -- This professional 6.3-inch meat cleaver is classified as a multi-function kitchen knife. The sharp knife can easily handle Butchering, Fishing, Hunting, Camping, Survival and Outdoor BBQ activities. The butcher knife also performs well at many kitchen tasks like mincing, slicing, and chopping vegetables, slicing meat, deboning of lamb,steak. It’s definitely your practical assistant no matter when you are indoor or outdoor. GUARANTEE -- All of our knives pass strict quality control before shipped. And we offer 30-day money back guarantee for any reason. Our goal is to provide the highest quality at the best price and ensuring that our customers are always satisfied with our products and service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717RAAlzy-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Freelander","source_asin":"B0BYRBN4YR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-364634","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYRBN4YR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYRBN4YR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
