window.products.push({"id":364670,"name":"Pimpernel Morris & Co Strawberry Thief Red Large Handled Tray | Serving Tray for Lunch, Coffee, or Breakfast | Made of Melamine | Measures 18.9\" x 11.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713-P0OCWpL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"INCREDIBLE ARTISTRY: The intricate Strawberry Thief design forms part of the Morris & Co for Pimpernel collection. William Morris was one of the most influential designers of the nineteenth Century and through his company, Morris & Co., he produced some of the most fashionable and exciting textiles and wallpapers of his era. SERVING MADE SIMPLE: Our quality melamine trays are strong, robust and durable, and, being dishwasher-safe, are also brilliantly practical. Not only hardwearing, they are also beautiful and feature a variety of decorative designs, perfectly complementing our comprehensive collection of placemats and coasters. SOMETHING FOR EVERYONE: Pimpernel is the premier brand for placemats, coasters, trays and accessories, with an outstanding and unique range that is renowned for its high quality. Pimpernel's exclusive homewares, textiles and gifts are created to suit all tastes, and make wonderful additions to the home. TIMELESS DESIGNS: Portmeirion was founded by legendary ceramic designer Susan William-Ellis in 1960 and has remained at the forefront of contemporary design ever since. Renowned for our tableware and giftware, Portmeirion produces beautiful and unique collections all of which are made to the highest standard to be enjoyed every day. PRODUCT SPECIFICATIONS: Package contains (1) Pimpernel Morris & Co Strawberry Thief Red Collection Large Handled Tray. Made of Melamine. Handled Tray measures 18.9 x 11.6 inches. Product is dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713-P0OCWpL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pimpernel","source_asin":"B00D7IKJTY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-364670","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00D7IKJTY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00D7IKJTY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
