window.products.push({"id":364798,"name":"COZCOT Khaki Duvet Cover King, 100% Organic Cotton, GOTS Certified, Premium 220 Thread Count Soft Twill Weave, Bottom Ties Closure, Durable and Easy C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.16,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613ffKBSAJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% COTTON DUVET COVER. 100% Cotton Twill Weave Duvet Cover brings the softness and durability to your bed. Surprised by its silky, smooth and soft texture, feels like sleeping on a premium hotel bed. Using high quality selected Long-Staple Cotton yarns, makes it outstanding in Twill 220 TC sheets. Variable colors available to match with your duvet, comforter in White, Navy Blue, Pink, Olive Green, Magic Grey, Red, Khaki. THE BEST FIT FOR KING OR CALIFORNIA KING SIZE DUVET OR COMFORTER: Our duvet cover features with thick edged hemmed design; luxurious look gives your room a brand-new look. The bottom ties’ design secures your duvets or comforter stay tucked in, and won’t slip away. The 1-piece king, California king duvet cover include 1 duvet cover (110’’ W x 96’’ L). QUALITY CERTIFIED COTTON SHEETS FOR YOUR SAFETY: We source pure organic cotton that is grown naturally without any chemicals or harmful substance. Unlike microfiber and other types of linen, cotton is better for the environment, keeps you warm and cozy, and keeps you comfortable. Moreover, the STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX certification, and GOTS certification ensures that our cotton sheets are free from harmful dyes and chemicals, making them safe for you and your family and your kids to use at home. EASY TO CARE: Our top-rated cotton duvet covers are machine washable and don't fade when washed since they are made with the best quality dyes. Additionally, they do not pill or shrink easily. Compared to silk, which require expert maintenance, Twill sheet is more robust, affordable, and lasting. Give the duvet cover a few washes to achieve its smoothness as cotton softens with washing. We advise washing it first if you are sensitive skin. BUY WITH CONFIDENCE - Our Twill duvet covers are some of the softest Twill duvet cover you can find online, they are backed by incredible customer service to make sure your satisfaction is guaranteed. If you don’t like our duvet cover, you can return them for a refund or replacement as per Amazon guidelines, no question asked.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613ffKBSAJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COZCOT","source_asin":"B09XDKP766","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-364798","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XDKP766","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XDKP766","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":364799,"name":"Levtex Home - Terrington Duvet Cover Set - King Duvet Cover (106 x 94in.) + Two King Pillow Cases (36 x 20in.) - Stripe White and Blue - Cotton","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":90.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TcskjFxmS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LEVTEX Terrington DUVET SET: The Terrington comforter collection is a an intricate tribal jacquard in cream tufted chenille and frayed cotton on a white cotton ground. The set consists of a King size comforter (106 x 94in.) and two matching pillow cases (36 x 20in.). THE Terrington DESIGN: One of our most popular sets, Terrington is hip, dimensional and contemporary. The front is a tufted and frayed cream tribal pattern on white and the reverse is solid cream 100% cotton. The comforter is filled with soft, hypoallergenic 100% polyester. SOFT AND COMFORTABLE LUXURY: Made from 100% cotton that will never feel heavy, stiff or uncomfortable, the Terrington comforter set has a great texture and an ultra soft cotton reverse that you will simply love. Our comforter is very generously sized (106 x 94in.) to give your bedroom a feeling of comfort and luxury. Make sure it is the correct size to fit your comforter inner. EASY CARE: The Terrington comforter set is easy to look after. Simply machine wash on a cold, gentle cycle, then line dry or tumble dry at low temperature. COORDINATE YOUR ROOM DECOR: Create a wonderful bedroom space with our coordinated comforter set. The dimensional jacquard detailing design brings hip, dimensional and contemporary accents into your home and will match a variety of different looks and bedroom decor. You can also freshen your room with matching other items from the Levtex Home collection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TcskjFxmS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Levtex Home","source_asin":"B0887B9FXC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-364799","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0887B9FXC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0887B9FXC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
