window.products.push({"id":364805,"name":"PYRAWS Eco Friendly Glass Straws | Portable Case | Cleaning Brushes | 8\" x 8 mm Reusable Drinking Straw Case Set | Shatter Resistant | Food Grade Glas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QiNW6XaaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ECO-FRIENDLY STRAW CASE: Introducing a stylish and practical solution for your glass straws - a protective and aesthetically pleasing case set! Our product comes in a specially designed portable box that keeps your glass straws safe and secure while adding an elegant touch to your collection. The travel box offers numerous advantages such as being, durable, and long-lasting. It is also incredibly lightweight and compact, making it easy to carry in your purse or backpack. The case provides protection to prevent the breakage of your glass straws. HEALTHY LIFE BEGINS WITH HEALTHY STRAW SET: High quality 100% borosilicate glass Complete bundle you will get 2 colored reusable straight and bent glass straws + 1 muddler stick + 1 cleaning brushes + 1 custom design colored protective carrying case holder. Multi Color - Green, Orange, Pink, Blue Sets. This width is similar to that of a typical restaurant straw. It’s great for thin liquids such as water, juice or a slightly slushy pina colada. The same straws can be used for years. The PYRAWS reusable glass straws were designed for easy travel. DESIGNED FOR HEALTHY USE: Made from 100% COE 3.3 borosilicate glass (Main Composition: SiO2, B2O3, Al2O3, Na2O+K2O, 80±0.5%, 13±0.2%, 2.4±0.2%, 4.3±0.2%). It is also user-friendly with its easy-to-clean and reusable features. Besides being thrown into the dishwasher easy enough, we've even added a cleaning brush to make absolutely sure that you get the exact clean you want out of your straw set. Simply rinse them out after every use, or use cleaning brush. USE THEM EVERYDAY IN ANY DRINK: These straws are the perfect accompaniment to any drink throughout the day, including smoothies, iced coffee, protein shakes, cocktails, lemonade, hot chocolate, water, sodas, from hot to cold drinks, and more. Surprised at how much better the glass straw feels on your lips as opposed to the normal plastic straws you use! It is foldable and easy to be carried for your travel. Great single-use plastic replacement for a family picnic, party, office, dorm and etc. It is a GREEN gift. ERGONOMIC DESIGN: The size of the glass straw is compatible with most glasses and jars, making it easy to use with any beverage. Ideal for both hot and cold drinks. Come in an individual box so you can share the amazement with your family or friends it is definitely a great product and a must-have! This glass straw could be a small but powerful step towards saving our oceans from plastic waste! Switching to eco-friendly glass straws is not just a conscious choice for the environment, but also a stylish addition to any beverage experience. Discover our beautiful and durable glass straw and straw set with a protective case, designed for those who seek an eco-friendly, stylish, and functional product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QiNW6XaaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PYRAWS","source_asin":"B0BYSQ3V18","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-364805","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYSQ3V18","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYSQ3V18","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
