window.products.push({"id":364860,"name":"fowong Heavy Duty Under Door Noise Stopper, 38 Inch Upgrade Tri-Proof Door Draft Guard Weatherproof Under Door Blocker with Hanging Cord Window Seal B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CZB4UoteL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PRO DOOR DRAFT STOPPER- Multi-Function & Size for choice, fowong under door seal is filled with polyester wadding, especially add Glass Bead to make this draft blocker Heavier. The most important thing is that we upgraded the outside fabric. The new Upgrade fabric performs functional finishing such as water/ oil/ stain-proof finishing) and moisture management finishing, the products show excellent characteristics of fabric comfort and easy process. WIDELY USAGE- This upgrade door stopper can help to stop drafts under the door, also able to keep out wind, dust, light of a crack, etc. Helps the heat stays in and cold air stays out. Your indoor air circulation will not be destroyed. To some extent, helps reduce sounds and noises, odor, etc. EASY INSTALLATION-Totally tool free, just apply the included hook loop strip to your door, then stick the door guard blocker. Measure the gap to choose the right size or consult our customer service. Do not place the stopper too close to the floor for better stickiness. CONVENIENT STORAGE-The elegant appearance and unique hooks and loops design make it more convenient to hang and store, and it can be hung wherever you want to place it, such as wardrobes and utility rooms. EXCELLENT AFTER-SALES- If you have any questions about the Under Door Draft Snake, please feel free to contact us and let us know how to make it right. We will provide the best after-sales service for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CZB4UoteL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"fowong","source_asin":"B098JZM2H3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-364860","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098JZM2H3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098JZM2H3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
