window.products.push({"id":365001,"name":"Vikko Clear Glass Footed Ice Cream Dessert Bowls | For Ice, Pudding, Fruit, and More – 5.5 Ounce Dessert Cups – Set Of 6 Thick Glass Serving Dishes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51de8utKRlL._AC_.jpg","description":"VERSATILE: They’re not just for ice cream. These bowls are perfect for chocolate mousse, yogurt and fruit parfaits, small snacks and candies, and even martinis. With their stemmed elegance, these cups make even the simplest of desserts look fancy. STURDY BASE: Thick bottoms are designed to aid balance and prevent tipping. Keeps the ice cream in your cup instead of all over the table. BUILT TO LAST: Life happens, and we know that. That’s why these we designed these glasses to be thick and durable, so you can stop worrying about breakage and enjoy your drink in peace. Glasses are pretty enough for company, durable enough for busy families with kids. 5.5 OUNCE GLASSES, SET OF SIX: These small dishes are just the right size for a scoop of ice cream, a nice sized portion of pudding, or bit of cut up fruit. And with a set of six, you’ll never have to worry about running out of cups, even if you have company or didn’t run the dishwasher last night. DISHWASHER SAFE: When the party is done, just toss these glasses into the washer and let the machine get them clean for you. Makes for a super simple cleanup and gives you time to eat some more ice cream, too!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51de8utKRlL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vikko","source_asin":"B07XBMPXFH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-365001","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XBMPXFH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XBMPXFH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
